---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, '');
---

<Layout title="Private Internet Access (PIA) 深度评测 - GlobalNet Labs">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <a href={`${base}/vpn`} onclick="history.back();return false;" class="text-sm text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-6">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
        返回 VPN 列表
      </a>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-10">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-14 h-14 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
          <img src={`${base}/images/pia.png`} alt="Private Internet Access (PIA)" class="max-w-full max-h-full w-auto h-auto object-contain" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-1">Private Internet Access (PIA) 深度评测</h1>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-lg">老牌隐私守护者，万兆网络无限设备</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">评分概览</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-400">7.5</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">综合评分</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">8.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">响应速度</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">8.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">服务器覆盖</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">隐私保护</div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg border border-slate-800/50">
            <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100">7.0</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">性价比</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">产品概述</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Private Internet Access 成立于 2010 年，总部位于美国，是全球知名的老牌 VPN 服务商之一。提供 10000+ 服务器覆盖 90+ 国家，支持无限设备同时连接。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          采用独立审计的无日志政策，内置 MACE 广告/追踪器/恶意软件拦截功能。支持 WireGuard、OpenVPN 和 IKEv2 协议，提供 10Gbps 万兆网络带宽。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          以其高性价比和不限设备连接数在用户群体中享有良好的口碑。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">核心特性详解</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">无限设备连接</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">PIA 支持无限设备同时连接在同一账户下。不限设备数量，家庭或团队可共享一个订阅。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">MACE 广告拦截</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">内置 MACE 功能可在 DNS 层面拦截广告、追踪器和恶意软件，无需额外安装插件。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">10Gbps 万兆网络</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">10000+ 服务器全部配备 10Gbps 带宽端口，保证高速稳定的连接体验。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">独立审计无日志</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">经过 Deloitte 独立审计验证的无日志政策。不记录流量、DNS 查询或连接时间。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">协议灵活性</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">支持 WireGuard、OpenVPN 和 IKEv2 三种主流协议。根据网络环境自由切换。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-950/50 rounded-lg p-5 border border-slate-800/50">
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">端口转发</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">支持端口转发功能，适合 P2P 文件共享、自建服务器等进阶网络需求。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">适用场景详细分析</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">1. 多设备保护</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">无限设备连接特性使其成为家庭或小团队的理想选择。一次订阅保护所有设备。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">2. 日常隐私浏览</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">MACE 广告拦截和加密隧道提供全面的日常隐私保护。万兆网络保证高速体验。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">3. P2P 文件共享</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">支持端口转发和 P2P 流量，适合 BitTorrent 等文件共享场景。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-lg mb-2">4. 广告过滤</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">内置 MACE 功能无需额外配置即可过滤广告和追踪器。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-6">优势与局限</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>优势
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>无限设备同时连接</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>10000+ 服务器覆盖 90+ 国家</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>10Gbps 万兆网络</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>MACE 广告拦截内置</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>高性价比长期方案</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-amber-400 font-semibold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-2.5L13.732 4c-.77-.833-1.964-.833-2.732 0L3.34 16.5c-.77.833.192 2.5 1.732 2.5z"/></svg>注意事项
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>美国管辖五眼联盟</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>流媒体解锁表现一般</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300"><span class="text-amber-400 mt-0.5">•</span><span>旧版客户端体验一般</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">总结评价</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Private Internet Access 凭借 10000+ 服务器、无限设备连接和万兆网络带宽，在 VPN 市场中占据重要地位。MACE 广告拦截和独立审计无日志政策增强了其隐私保护能力。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          美国管辖和流媒体解锁能力有限是其主要短板。但综合性价比仍然是市场中最具吸引力的选择之一。
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          综合评估，PIA 获得 7.5 分，适合需要多设备保护和追求高性价比的用户。
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="https://www.privateinternetaccess.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 font-semibold rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 text-lg">
          访问 PIA 官网
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
